### 1. Generate Full Diagnostic Report for Session 1 (Aggregates Session + Proctor + Scores)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/reports/generate/1

### 2. Fetch Generated Report by Report ID
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/reports/1

### 3. Fetch Report by Session ID
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/reports/session/1

### 4. Fetch All Past Reports for Candidate
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/reports/candidate/john-doe-42